The input hook J3 Bots reads keys, clicks and the wheel through while it
records the screen (decision 0098 in the J3 Bots repository) is the prebuilt
binary of uiohook-napi 1.5.5, in uiohook-napi/prebuilds/<platform>-<arch>/.

